Vendored research code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The module aran-operators/constraint-discovery contains a vendored copy of the
DTAK constraint-discovery research codebase (the LIMA lattice scheduler), in the
packages:

    edu.upc.lima
    edu.upc.lattice
    edu.upc.data
    edu.upc.utils

This code originates in the group's research repository rather than in Aran, and
retains its own dataset and schema model. It is copyright the same holder named
above and is distributed here under the Apache License, Version 2.0, along with
the rest of this product.

See aran-operators/constraint-discovery/VENDORED.md for the rules of engagement
for that code, including the requirement that upstream fixes land in the research
repository first so the copies do not fork.
